/E (I graduated with my MSc and MPhil in Mathematics in Quaid-i-Azam University, Islamabad. I have started my PhD in Spring, 2012 in International Islamic University, Islamabad under the guidance of Prof. Dr. Nasir Ali. I joined Karachi Institute of Power Engineering \(KINPOE\) in December 2012 as a scientist during my doctoral studies. Balancing work and PhD research was not an easy task, and with the help of hard work, I managed to finish my PhD in approximately  years and published five research papers pertaining to qualitative analysis of fluid dynamics.)
