/E (The horizon is modeled as punctured by spin network links, each contributing a quantized area. Fixing the macroscopic area, one counts all quantum configurations compatible with it; the logarithm of this count gives the entropy. This reproduces the area law with small logarithmic corrections, providing a microscopic foundation for black hole thermodynamics.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
