/Title (Scientists at the UK Atomic Energy Authority \(UKAEA\) advanced fusion research by using artificial intelligence to model plasma turbulence, a key challenge in controlled nuclear fusion. AI trained on experimental data predicted plasma behavior much faster than traditional methods. This breakthrough allows for quick testing of reactor designs and control strategies, speeding up the development of practical fusion energy and showcasing AI's potential to overcome computational barriers in experimental physics.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1465 0 R
