/Title (In 2025, Zap Energy Inc. achieved gigapascal-level plasma pressures in its compact fusion device, FuZE-3, using a sheared-flow-stabilized Z-pinch configuration. This milestone showed that extreme fusion conditions can be reached without large tokamak reactors, enhancing understanding of high-energy-density plasma physics and supporting smaller, simpler, and potentially more economical fusion energy approaches.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1473 0 R
/First 1486 0 R
